    },
    "Added drowsiness and next-day grogginess, with more fall and coordination risk. Unlike a benzo, an orexin antagonist doesn't suppress breathing, so this isn't the deadly opioid+benzo combination — but still use less, and don't drive." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会增加困倦和次日昏沉，跌倒和协调障碍风险更高。与苯二氮䓬类不同，食欲素拮抗剂不会抑制呼吸，因此这不是致命的阿片+苯二氮䓬组合——但仍应减量，且不要开车。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "會增加睏倦和隔日昏沉，跌倒和協調障礙風險更高。與苯二氮平類不同，食慾素拮抗劑不會抑制呼吸，因此這不是致命的鴉片+苯二氮平組合——但仍應減量，且不要開車。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Additional Info" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更多信息"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更多資訊"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Additive CNS and respiratory depression — antihistamines potentiate opioid sedation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中枢和呼吸抑制相加 — 抗组胺药增强阿片的镇静作用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中樞和呼吸抑制相加 — 抗組胺藥增強阿片的鎮靜作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Additive CNS and respiratory depression, with a raised risk of vomiting while unresponsive." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中枢与呼吸抑制相加，并且在失去反应时呕吐的风险升高。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中樞與呼吸抑制相加，並且在失去反應時嘔吐的風險升高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Additive CNS and respiratory depression." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中枢和呼吸抑制相加。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中樞和呼吸抑制相加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Additive CNS depression — increased sedation and impaired coordination." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中枢抑制相加 — 镇静加剧、协调受损。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中樞抑制相加 — 鎮靜加劇、協調受損。"
