            "value" : "鎮靜相加 — 可能加劇嗜睡和協調受損。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Additive sedation and low blood pressure — increased drowsiness and dizziness." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镇静与低血压叠加——困倦和头晕增加。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鎮靜與低血壓疊加——睏倦和頭暈增加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Additive sedation and next-day grogginess — more drowsiness, dizziness, and fall risk. Use less and avoid driving." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镇静作用和次日昏沉相加——更明显的困倦、头晕和跌倒风险。请减量并避免开车。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鎮靜作用和隔日昏沉相加——更明顯的睏倦、頭暈和跌倒風險。請減量並避免開車。"
          }
