    "Adds up sedation and lowers blood pressure further — expect stronger drowsiness and dizziness. Use less and don't drive." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镇静叠加并进一步降低血压——困倦和头晕会更明显。减量，且不要开车。"
