    "after 21:00" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "21:00 之后"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "21:00 之後"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a break or in a new setting, tolerance drops — a dose that felt fine before can stop your breathing. Restart low." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停一阵子或换了环境后耐受会掉——以前没事的剂量，这时可能让你停止呼吸。重新开始一定要减量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停一陣子或換了環境後耐受會掉——以前沒事的劑量，這時可能讓你停止呼吸。重新開始一定要減量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After you log a med you've opted in, a nudge when its next dose window opens. An estimate, not medical advice — opt in per med." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记录你已选择开启的药物后，会在下一剂窗口开启时提醒你。这只是估算，并非医疗建议——请按药物逐一开启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "記錄你已選擇開啟的藥物後，會在下一劑窗口開啟時提醒你。這只是估算，並非醫療建議——請按藥物逐一開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Afterglow" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "余韵"
