    "Each card is that substance's own contribution. Mechanisms are shared, so your overall level (the chart above, or By mechanism) can be higher." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每张卡片是该物质自身的贡献。机制是共享的，所以你的整体水平（上方图表或“按机制”）可能更高。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每張卡片是該物質自身的貢獻。機制是共享的，所以你的整體水平（上方圖表或「按機制」）可能更高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each line as a share of its own peak" : {

    },
    "Each row lists what that source supplied here. Links open the source's own page — always verify against the original." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一行列出该来源在此提供的内容。链接会打开来源自身的页面——请始终对照原始资料核实。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一行列出該來源在此提供的內容。連結會開啟來源自身的頁面——請始終對照原始資料核實。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat a nutritious meal, drink water, and rest. Magnesium and vitamin C may help. Don't fight the tiredness — your body needs recovery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃一顿营养餐、喝水并休息。镁和维生素 C 可能有帮助。不要对抗疲劳 — 您的身体需要恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃一頓營養餐、喝水並休息。鎂和維生素 C 可能有幫助。不要對抗疲勞 — 您的身體需要恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat light foods: fruit, toast, soup. Your stomach may be sensitive." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃清淡食物:水果、吐司、汤。您的胃可能比较敏感。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃清淡食物:水果、吐司、湯。您的胃可能比較敏感。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something — even if you're not hungry. Protein and complex carbs help most." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃点东西 — 即使您不饿。蛋白质和复合碳水化合物最有帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃點東西 — 即使您不餓。蛋白質和複合碳水化合物最有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something balanced. The munchies may have had you eating junk." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些均衡的食物。嘴馋可能让您吃了垃圾食品。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些均衡的食物。嘴饞可能讓您吃了垃圾食品。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something grounding — warm food, fruit, or anything that sounds appealing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些让人安定的东西 — 温热的食物、水果或任何想吃的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些讓人安定的東西 — 溫熱的食物、水果或任何想吃的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something light. Your appetite may be suppressed but food helps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些清淡的东西。食欲可能受抑制,但食物有帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些清淡的東西。食慾可能受抑制,但食物有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something nutritious — protein, carbs, and fruit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些营养食物 — 蛋白质、碳水化合物和水果"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些營養食物 — 蛋白質、碳水化合物和水果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eat something with salt, protein, and carbs. Your body needs fuel to recover." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些含盐、蛋白质和碳水的食物。您的身体需要燃料恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃些含鹽、蛋白質和碳水的食物。您的身體需要燃料恢復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eating disorder" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "进食障碍"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "飲食障礙"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EC50 %@ nM" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EC50 %@ nM"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EC50 %@ nM"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EDDP has no opioid activity — it's the primary urinary marker for methadone compliance monitoring, not a contributor to the drug's effect or duration." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EDDP 无阿片活性——它是美沙酮依从性监测的主要尿液标志物,不参与药物效应或持续时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EDDP 無鴉片活性——它是美沙酮依從性監測的主要尿液標誌物,不參與藥物效應或持續時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edibles also come on slowly — usually 30 minutes to 2 hours — and last much longer, often 6–10 hours. That slow start is the redose trap: wait at least 2 hours before taking more, or you can stack a far stronger, longer dose than you meant to." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "食用大麻起效也很慢——通常为 30 分钟到 2 小时——而且持续时间长得多，常达 6–10 小时。这种缓慢起效正是重复用药的陷阱：再次服用前至少等待 2 小时，否则你可能叠加出远比预期更强、更长的剂量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "食用大麻起效也很慢——通常為 30 分鐘到 2 小時——而且持續時間長得多，常達 6–10 小時。這種緩慢起效正是重複用藥的陷阱：再次服用前至少等待 2 小時，否則你可能疊加出遠比預期更強、更長的劑量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
