        }
      }
    },
    "Every curve starts as a number you typed and ends as a line on a chart. These are the steps in between." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每条曲线都始于你输入的一个数字，终于图上的一条线。以下是中间的每一步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每條曲線都始於你輸入的一個數字，終於圖上的一條線。以下是中間的每一步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every dose lands on a timeline so you can see what's active — and when it fades." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一笔剂量都会落在时间轴上，让你看清什么正在起效——以及何时消退。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一筆劑量都會落在時間軸上，讓你看清什麼正在起效——以及何時消退。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every hour" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每小时"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每小時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every layer above is pharmacodynamic — it is computed from your dose log and the clock. A large part of real tolerance is associative and context-specific: it attaches to the setting, the ritual and the cues around a dose, which is why tolerance measured in a familiar context can be substantially higher than tolerance in an unfamiliar one, and why the same cues without the dose can produce the opposite of the drug's effect. Piru cannot see any of that, because it does not record where you were or what you were doing. Treat the shift as a pharmacological estimate, not a total." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上面所有层级都是药效动力学层面的——根据你的剂量记录和时间来计算。真实耐受中有很大一部分是联结性的、跟环境绑定的：它和用药时的地点、仪式、周围的线索绑在一起。这就是为什么在熟悉环境下测到的耐受可以远高于陌生环境，也是为什么同样的线索、没有药物时，身体可以产生药效的反面。Piru 看不到这些，因为它不记录你在哪里、在做什么。把这个数字当作药理学估计来看，不是总量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上面所有層級都是藥效動力學層面的——根據你的劑量記錄和時間來計算。真實耐受中有很大一部分是聯結性的、跟環境綁定的：它和用藥時的地點、儀式、周圍的線索綁在一起。這就是為什麼在熟悉環境下測到的耐受可以遠高於陌生環境，也是為什麼同樣的線索、沒有藥物時，身體可以產生藥效的反面。Piru 看不到這些，因為它不記錄你在哪裡、在做什麼。把這個數字當作藥理學估計來看，不是總量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every other day" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隔日"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隔日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every substance shares one set of neural constants. Only the store-depletion susceptibility is fitted per substance, anchored to the observed contrast between an amphetamine crash and a crashless cathinone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有物质共用同一组神经常数。只有存量耗竭易感性是逐物质拟合的，其锚点是安非他命崩落与不产生崩落的卡西酮之间的实测反差。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有物質共用同一組神經常數。只有存量耗竭易感性是逐物質擬合的，其錨點是安非他命崩落與不產生崩落的卡西酮之間的實測反差。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyday substances, by the names most people know." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日常物质，以大多数人熟知的名称呈现。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日常物質，以大多數人熟知的名稱呈現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything — receptor binding tables, biased agonism, CYP metabolism, citations down to DOI." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部内容 — 受体结合表、偏向性激动、CYP 代谢，以及精确到 DOI 的文献引用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部內容 — 受體結合表、偏向性激動、CYP 代謝，以及精確到 DOI 的文獻引用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything Piru stores locally. Your dose data lives only on this device unless you turn on iCloud backup." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 在本机存储的全部内容。除非开启 iCloud 备份，你的剂量数据只保存在这台设备上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 在本機儲存的全部內容。除非開啟 iCloud 備份，你的劑量資料只保存在這部裝置上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything present draws on one shared pool of free transporters, so a second substance finds fewer sites open. This is the point where combinations stop being additive." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在场的所有物质共用同一个空闲转运体池，因此第二种物质可用的位点更少。组合效应正是从这里开始不再是简单相加。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在場的所有物質共用同一個空閒轉運體池，因此第二種物質可用的位點更少。組合效應正是從這裡開始不再是簡單相加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything that doesn't fit a class above." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不属于以上任何类别的物质。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不屬於以上任何類別的物質。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything's rested — nothing recovering right now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一切都休息好了——现在没有在恢复的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一切都休息好了——現在沒有在恢復的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Evidence source: %@, %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数据来源：%@，%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "數據來源：%@，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Example chart: an alcohol effect curve with heart rate rising and falling alongside it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "示例图表：酒精效应曲线，心率随之起伏。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
