    "Heavy chronic use has shifted your baseline; the deepest part recovers over months." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长期大量使用已经把你的基线压低了；最深的那部分要几个月才能恢复。"
