          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long after taking it the level in your blood is highest — roughly when effects peak." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用药后多久血液中的浓度达到最高——大致也是效果最强的时刻。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用藥後多久血液中的濃度達到最高——大致也是效果最強的時刻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Long It Stays" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在体内停留多久"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在體內停留多久"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much detail?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "想看多少细节？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "想看多少細節？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of a dose actually reaches your bloodstream. Swallowing a drug usually delivers less than injecting it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次用药中真正进入血液的比例。口服通常比注射进入血液的量更少。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次用藥中真正進入血液的比例。口服通常比注射進入血液的量更少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of a dose becomes its active form is partly genetic — the same dose can produce noticeably more effect in some people than in others." : {

    },
    "How much of each substance is still in your body — what's left and what you feel don't always line up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每种物质在你体内的残留量——剩余量与体感并不总是一致。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每種物質在你體內的殘留量——剩餘量與體感並不總是一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How strong it is compared to %@ hasn't been established." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其相对于 %@ 的强度尚无定论。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其相對於 %@ 的強度尚無定論。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the drug acts in the body — which receptors and transporters it targets, and what it does at each (switches them on, blocks them, and so on). The dots show how strongly it acts at each target." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "药物在体内如何起作用——它作用于哪些受体和转运体，以及在每个靶点上做什么（激活、阻断等）。圆点表示它在各靶点上的作用强度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "藥物在體內如何起作用——它作用於哪些受體和轉運體，以及在每個靶點上做什麼（激活、阻斷等）。圓點表示它在各靶點上的作用強度。"
          }
        }
      }
