    },
    "Identify" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "识别"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "識別"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identify a Box" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "识别药盒"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "識別藥盒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If a dose isn't logged, ask again after these intervals. Applies to every med. A med can override or opt out in its own settings. Re-asks never scold — they just ask." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果剂量未记录，按这些间隔再次提醒。适用于所有药物。每种药物可单独覆盖或退出。再次提醒绝不训斥——只是问一声。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果劑量未記錄，按這些間隔再次提醒。適用於所有藥物。每種藥物可單獨覆蓋或退出。再次提醒絕不訓斥——只是問一聲。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If nauseous, small sips of water and lying on your side help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感到恶心时,小口喝水并侧卧有帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感到噁心時,小口喝水並側臥有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this is frequent for you, consider talking to a professional about alternatives." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果这对您很频繁,请考虑与专业人士讨论替代方案。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果這對您很頻繁,請考慮與專業人士討論替代方案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If withdrawal symptoms concern you, seek medical advice. Help exists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果担心戒断症状,请寻求医疗建议。帮助是存在的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果擔心戒斷症狀,請尋求醫療建議。幫助是存在的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you are using phenibut or F-phenibut daily, dependence develops within weeks. Protracted withdrawal can last months — taper gradually with medical guidance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你每天使用苯乙胺丁酸或氟苯乙胺丁酸，数周内就会产生依赖。迁延性戒断可持续数月——在医疗指导下逐步减量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你每天使用苯乙胺丁酸或氟苯乙胺丁酸，數週內就會產生依賴。遷延性戒斷可持續數月——在醫療指導下逐步減量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel anxious, focus on slow breathing. It passes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感到焦虑,专注于慢呼吸。它会过去。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感到焦慮,專注於慢呼吸。它會過去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel nauseous, lie on your side and sip ginger tea or plain water." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感到恶心时,侧卧并小口喝姜茶或清水。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感到噁心時,側臥並小口喝薑茶或清水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel spacey, grounding exercises: name 5 things you can see, 4 you can touch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感觉飘忽,做接地练习:说出 5 件您能看见的、4 件能触摸的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果感覺飄忽,做接地練習:說出 5 件您能看見的、4 件能觸摸的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you feel unwell, don't hesitate to call for help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如感到不适,请毫不犹豫地寻求帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如感到不適,請毫不猶豫地尋求幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you have been drinking heavily and daily for weeks, stopping abruptly can be medically dangerous — seizures and delirium tremens peak 2–4 days after the last drink. Seek medical advice before going cold turkey." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你连续数周每天大量饮酒，突然戒断可能非常危险——癫痫发作和震颤性谵妄通常在最后一杯后 2–4 天达到高峰。戒酒前请先咨询医生。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你連續數週每天大量飲酒，突然戒斷可能非常危險——癲癇發作和震顫性譫妄通常在最後一杯後 2–4 天達到高峰。戒酒前請先諮詢醫師。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you lose this passphrase, the backup can't be recovered. There is no reset." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你丢失此口令，备份将无法恢复。无法重置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你遺失此通行碼，備份將無法還原。無法重設。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you need help right now:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果您现在需要帮助:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果您現在需要幫助:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If You Stop" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你停用"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你停用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you stop: withdrawal timing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你停用：戒断时间"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你停用：戒斷時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you've been using regularly, talk to a doctor about tapering — never stop abruptly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果您一直规律使用,请咨询医生关于逐渐减量 — 切勿突然停药。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果您一直規律使用,請諮詢醫生關於逐漸減量 — 切勿突然停藥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your jaw is sore, gentle massage and magnesium help." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果下颌酸痛,轻柔按摩和镁有帮助。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果下顎痠痛,輕柔按摩和鎂有幫助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
