    "Life-threatening respiratory depression — this combination is a leading cause of overdose death." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "危及生命的呼吸抑制 — 此组合是过量致死的主要原因。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "危及生命的呼吸抑制 — 此組合是過量致死的主要原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Life-threatening respiratory depression and loss of consciousness — the classic fatal combination." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "危及生命的呼吸抑制与意识丧失——典型的致命组合。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "危及生命的呼吸抑制與意識喪失——典型的致命組合。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Life-threatening respiratory depression. A barbiturate opens the GABA-A channel directly rather than modulating it, so this stacks past the point where benzodiazepines alone level off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "危及生命的呼吸抑制。巴比妥类直接打开 GABA-A 通道，而不只是调节它，因此这一组合会越过苯二氮䓬类单用时趋于平缓的那个点继续叠加。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "危及生命的呼吸抑制。巴比妥類直接打開 GABA-A 通道，而不只是調節它，因此這一組合會越過苯二氮平類單用時趨於平緩的那個點繼續疊加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
