    },
    "Manual exports turn your passphrase into a key with 600,000 rounds of PBKDF2. The passphrase is never saved or sent. Choose one you won't forget — there's no recovery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手动导出会用 600,000 轮 PBKDF2 将你的口令转换为密钥。口令绝不会被保存或发送。请选择一个你不会忘记的口令——它无法找回。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手動匯出會以 600,000 輪 PBKDF2 將你的通行碼轉換為金鑰。通行碼絕不會被儲存或傳送。請選擇一個你不會忘記的通行碼——它無法找回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manual schedule" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手动方案"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手動方案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many values come from animal or lab-dish studies. Human data is the most reliable — the source tag tells you which it is." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "许多数值来自动物或体外（培养皿）实验。人体数据最为可靠——来源标签会标明属于哪一种。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "許多數值來自動物或體外（培養皿）實驗。人體數據最為可靠——來源標籤會標明屬於哪一種。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MAOIs block the enzyme that clears serotonin, so the load builds instead of levelling off. Serotonin syndrome is the risk; MAOIs do not raise lithium levels." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MAOI 阻断清除5-羟色胺的酶，因此负荷会不断累积而不是趋于平稳。风险是5-羟色胺综合征；MAOI 不会升高锂的血药浓度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MAOI 阻斷清除血清素的酶，因此負荷會不斷累積而不是趨於平穩。風險是血清素症候群；MAOI 不會升高鋰的血藥濃度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
