    },
    "May reduce hormonal birth-control efficacy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可能降低激素类避孕药的效果"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可能降低激素類避孕藥的效果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mCPP acts on serotonin in a different way than trazodone — it tends to feel activating or anxious rather than sedating, which is part of why trazodone's later hours can feel unlike its calm onset." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mCPP 以不同于曲唑酮的方式作用于血清素——它倾向于产生激活感或焦虑感,而非镇静,这是曲唑酮后半段感受可能与平静的起效阶段不同的部分原因。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "mCPP 以不同於曲唑酮的方式作用於血清素——它傾向於產生激活感或焦慮感,而非鎮靜,這是曲唑酮後半段感受可能與平靜的起效階段不同的部分原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MDA is an active drug of its own — more amphetamine-like and more hallucinogenic than MDMA, and longer-lived — so the later hours can feel qualitatively different from the peak." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDA 本身就是一种活性药物——比 MDMA 更像安非他明、致幻性更强，也更持久——因此后段时间的体验在性质上会与峰值不同。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDA 本身就是一種活性藥物——比 MDMA 更像安非他命、致幻性更強，也更持久——因此後段時間的體驗在性質上會與峰值不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MDMA" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MDMA releases serotonin in bulk and lithium adds to it, so serotonin syndrome is the main risk. Seizures are reported for lithium with classic psychedelics; MDMA has not been looked at the same way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA 会大量释放5-羟色胺，锂在此之上再加一份，因此主要风险是5-羟色胺综合征。锂与经典致幻剂合用有癫痫发作的报告；MDMA 没有被同样地研究过。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MDMA 會大量釋放血清素，鋰在此之上再加一份，因此主要風險是血清素症候群。鋰與經典致幻劑合用有癲癇發作的報告；MDMA 沒有被同樣地研究過。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
