    "No tolerance between sessions. Every simulation starts from a naive baseline; acclimation within the session is modeled, carry-over from yesterday is not." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不含跨次耐受。每次模拟都从未接触药物的基线开始；单次会话内的适应有被建模，但昨天的残留影响没有。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不含跨次耐受。每次模擬都從未接觸藥物的基線開始；單次會話內的適應有被建模，但昨天的殘留影響沒有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No tracked substance matches the current search and filters." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
