      }
    },
    "On the way down the expectation lags again. Dopamine returns to baseline while the expectation stays high, and that gap below the line is the comedown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在下降过程中，预期再次滞后。多巴胺已回到基线，预期却仍居高不下，基线之下的这段落差便是退效期。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在下降過程中，預期再次滯後。多巴胺已回到基線，預期卻仍居高不下，基線之下的這段落差便是退效期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
