        }
      }
    },
    "Piru Backup" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 备份"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 備份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru can keep it simple or go deep into the pharmacology. Change this anytime in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 可以保持简洁，也可以深入药理。随时可在设置中更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 可以保持簡潔，也可以深入藥理。隨時可在設定中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru couldn't open your journal this time, so it's running with temporary storage. **Nothing has been deleted** — your doses and sessions are safe on this device and a future update will restore them automatically.\n\nSending the logs helps us ship that fix faster. They describe the storage problem only — never your dose data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 这次未能打开你的日志，目前正以临时存储运行。**没有任何数据被删除**——你的剂量和记录仍安全保存在这台设备上，未来的更新会自动恢复它们。\n\n发送日志能帮助我们更快推出修复。日志只描述存储问题本身——绝不包含你的剂量数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 這次未能開啟你的日誌，目前正以暫時儲存空間執行。**沒有任何資料被刪除**——你的劑量和記錄仍安全保存在這部裝置上，未來的更新會自動還原它們。\n\n傳送記錄檔能幫助我們更快推出修正。記錄檔只描述儲存問題本身——絕不包含你的劑量資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru doesn't model a timeline for %@ %@. The session shows when each dose was taken, not how long it lasts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Piru doesn't model a timeline for %1$@ %2$@. The session shows when each dose was taken, not how long it lasts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 无法为 %2$@ 的 %1$@ 绘制时间线。本次记录只显示每次用药的时间，而非其持续时长。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 無法為 %2$@ 的 %1$@ 繪製時間線。本次記錄只顯示每次用藥的時間，而非其持續時長。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru doesn't model a timeline for these forms — the session shows when each dose was taken, not how long it lasts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 无法为这些剂型绘制时间线——本次记录只显示每次用药的时间，而非其持续时长。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 無法為這些劑型繪製時間線——本次記錄只顯示每次用藥的時間，而非其持續時長。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru is built for sensitive data. Yours never leaves your device unless you choose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 专为敏感数据而打造。除非你选择，你的数据绝不会离开设备。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 專為敏感資料而打造。除非你選擇，你的資料絕不會離開裝置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru never deletes a store outright. Copies set aside automatically (after an upgrade hiccup) or before you deleted or restored data appear here, ready to restore." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 绝不会直接删除数据存储。系统自动留存的副本（升级出现问题后），或在你删除、恢复数据之前留存的副本，都会显示在这里，随时可以恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 絕不會直接刪除資料儲存。系統自動留存的副本（升級出現問題後），或在你刪除、還原資料之前留存的副本，都會顯示在這裡，隨時可以還原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru only sends the notifications listed on this screen." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 只会发送此页面列出的通知。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 只會傳送此頁面列出的通知。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru shows the highest-priority source you've enabled that has this data — and you choose the order." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 会显示你已启用的、拥有该数据的最高优先级来源——顺序由你决定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 會顯示你已啟用的、擁有該數據的最高優先級來源——順序由你決定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru shows the source you rank highest — change that in Settings › Source Priority." : {
      "comment" : "Dose source comparison footer",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 显示你排序最高的来源——可在“设置 › 来源优先级”中更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Piru 顯示你排序最高的來源——可在「設定 › 來源優先順序」中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Piru will notify you as the comedown approaches with practical care reminders — hydration, nutrition, and rest tips tailored to what you took." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "缓和期来临时,Piru 会以实用的护理提醒通知您 — 根据您所服用的物质,提供补水、营养和休息建议。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "緩和期來臨時,Piru 會以實用的護理提醒通知您 — 根據您所服用的物質,提供補水、營養和休息建議。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
