      }
    },
    "Racetams, choline, and cognitive aids." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拉西坦类、胆碱与认知辅助剂。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拉西坦類、膽鹼與認知輔助劑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Raise dopamine and noradrenaline signalling, which raises drive, attention and wakefulness — and heart rate and temperature with them. They differ mostly in how they do it: releasing the neurotransmitter, or blocking its reuptake." : {

    },
    "Raise strength" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提高浓度"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提高濃度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Raise volume" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增加容量"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增加容量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Raises noradrenaline and serotonin release by blocking the α₂ autoreceptors that normally brake it, instead of blocking reuptake. The H₁ block alongside it is the sedation and the appetite." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过阻断本来起刹车作用的α₂自身受体来提高去甲肾上腺素和5-羟色胺的释放，而不是阻断再摄取。与之并行的H₁阻断，就是镇静和食欲的来源。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "透過阻斷本來起煞車作用的α₂自身受體來提高正腎上腺素和血清素的釋放，而不是阻斷回收。與之並行的H₁阻斷，就是鎮靜和食慾的來源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
