    },
    "Regular use over weeks builds physical dependence — stopping abruptly can be dangerous even if you don't feel tolerant. Taper gradually." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连续数周的规律使用会形成身体依赖——即使你没有感觉到耐受，突然停用也可能很危险。要逐步减量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "連續數週的規律使用會形成身體依賴——即使你沒有感覺到耐受，突然停用也可能很危險。要逐步減量。"
          }
        }
      }
