            "value" : "%@所剩不多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs down with use and returns over weeks. MDMA-type use is slower because it dents serotonin supply as well as the receptors." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用着用着会减弱，要好几周才回得来。MDMA 这类更慢，因为它连血清素的供应一起伤到了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用著用著會減弱，要好幾週才回得來。MDMA 這類更慢，因為它連血清素的供應一起傷到了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
