    "Sedative tolerance builds; dependence can develop within weeks of daily use. Phenibut withdrawal is among the most severe." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镇静耐受性会逐渐建立；每日使用数周即可产生依赖。苯乙胺丁酸的戒断反应属于最严重的类型之一。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
