          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是反彈效應。它會過去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is temporary. Your brain will replenish over the next few days." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是暂时的。接下来几天您的大脑会补充。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是暫時的。接下來幾天您的大腦會補充。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the only session." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是唯一的记录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是唯一的記錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This metabolite (HNK) barely touches the NMDA receptor ketamine acts on — it's studied for a separate, non-dissociative antidepressant effect, so it isn't simply ketamine continuing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这种代谢物(HNK)几乎不作用于氯胺酮所靶向的 NMDA 受体——它被研究的是一种独立的、非解离性的抗抑郁效应,因此并非氯胺酮效果的简单延续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這種代謝物(HNK)幾乎不作用於氯胺酮所靶向的 NMDA 受體——它被研究的是一種獨立的、非解離性的抗憂鬱效應,因此並非氯胺酮效果的簡單延續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
