    },
    "What you feel is a gap" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你感受到的是差距"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你感受到的是差距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you feel tracks a gap inside your dopamine system — the distance between the dopamine you have and the steady level your brain expects." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的感受反映的是多巴胺系统内部的一段落差——现有多巴胺水平与大脑所预期的稳定水平之间的距离。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的感受反映的是多巴胺系統內部的一段落差——現有多巴胺水平與大腦所預期的穩定水平之間的距離。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you noticed, in a shared vocabulary — so a later you can search for the moment the geometry started." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用共同词汇记下你注意到的——将来的你可以搜索几何图形出现的那一刻。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用共同詞彙記下你注意到的——將來的你可以搜尋幾何圖形出現的那一刻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your body makes from this dose. Not a measured level." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身体从这次剂量中生成的物质。并非实测数值。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "身體從這次劑量中生成的物質。並非實測數值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's happening" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在发生什么"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在發生什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's still active in your body right now" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此刻体内仍在起作用的物质"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此刻體內仍在起作用的物質"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时间"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a drug is taken repeatedly in the same place, with the same ritual, the body learns to pre-compensate — it starts pushing back before the dose even arrives. That conditioned response is a real part of tolerance: you feel less, partly because your system saw the cues and braced for it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在同一个地方、按同一套习惯反复用药，身体会学着提前代偿——还没等剂量生效就开始做出反向调整。这种条件反应确实是耐受的一部分：你感觉减弱了，有一部分原因正是你的系统看到了那些信号，提前做好了准备。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在同一個地方、按同一套習慣反覆用藥，身體會學著提前代償——還沒等劑量生效就開始做出反向調整。這種條件反應確實是耐受的一部分：你感覺減弱了，有一部分原因正是你的系統看到了那些訊號，提前做好了準備。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a session reaches this many different substances, the timeline splits overlapping curves into separate stacked lanes — one per substance — so a busy session stays readable. When off, every curve is always overlaid on one graph." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当某次记录达到这么多种不同物质时，时间线会将重叠的曲线拆分为独立的堆叠泳道——每种物质一条——让繁忙的记录依然清晰可读。关闭后，所有曲线始终叠加在同一张图上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當某次記錄達到這麼多種不同物質時，時間線會將重疊的曲線拆分為獨立的堆疊泳道——每種物質一條——讓繁忙的記錄依然清晰可讀。關閉後，所有曲線始終疊加在同一張圖上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When and how much you log" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在何时、记录了多少"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在何時、記錄了多少"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When dose and effect aren't proportional" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当剂量与效应不成正比时"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當劑量與效應不成正比時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When dose and exposure aren't proportional" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当剂量与暴露不成正比时"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當劑量與暴露不成正比時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When it peaks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最严重的时候"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最嚴重的時候"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, Piru encrypts your journal and saves it to your private iCloud Drive each time you leave the app. The key is stored only in your iCloud Keychain, so it's end-to-end encrypted — **neither Apple nor Piru can read it** — and it restores on your other devices signed in to the same Apple Account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，每次你离开 App 时，Piru 都会加密你的日志并保存到你的私人 iCloud 云盘。密钥只存储在你的 iCloud 钥匙串中，因此是端到端加密——**Apple 和 Piru 都无法读取**——并且会在登录同一 Apple 账户的其他设备上自动恢复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，每次你離開 App 時，Piru 都會加密你的日誌並儲存到你的私人 iCloud 雲碟。金鑰只儲存在你的 iCloud 鑰匙圈中，因此是端對端加密——**Apple 和 Piru 都無法讀取**——並且會在登入同一 Apple 帳號的其他裝置上自動還原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When several sources report the same fact — a dose, a duration — Piru shows the one nearest the top. Drag to set which you trust most." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当多个来源报告同一事实（如剂量、时长）时，Piru 会显示最靠上的那个。拖动以设置你最信任的来源。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當多個來源報告同一事實（如劑量、時長）時，Piru 會顯示最靠上的那個。拖動以設定你最信任的來源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When switching opioids, the equianalgesic dose is an over-estimate: tolerance to one opioid doesn't fully transfer to another. Clinicians start the new opioid **25–50% lower** than the calculated dose (more for high doses or frail/elderly people) and re-titrate. Never take the full converted dose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更换阿片时，等效镇痛剂量会被高估：对一种阿片的耐受不会完全转移到另一种。临床医生会将新阿片的起始剂量定为比计算值 **低 25–50%**（剂量高或体弱/年长者更低），再重新滴定。切勿直接服用完整的换算剂量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更換阿片時，等效鎮痛劑量會被高估：對一種阿片的耐受不會完全轉移到另一種。臨床醫生會將新阿片的起始劑量定為比計算值 **低 25–50%**（劑量高或體弱/年長者更低），再重新滴定。切勿直接服用完整的換算劑量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you stop, that push-back is briefly left unopposed — which is why withdrawal or a comedown often feels like the mirror of the drug's effects (a stimulant's flatness, an opioid's aches)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你一停，这股反向的推力会有一阵子没了对手——所以戒断或者落差感往往像药效的镜像（兴奋剂之后的提不起劲、阿片之后的浑身酸痛）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你一停，這股反向的推力會有一陣子沒了對手——所以戒斷或者落差感往往像藥效的鏡像（興奮劑之後的提不起勁、鴉片之後的渾身痠痛）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where a regular dose settles, from your own cadence" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按你自己的节奏，规律剂量最终稳定在何处"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按你自己的節奏，規律劑量最終穩定在何處"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where a repeated dose settles, and when" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重复用药最终稳定在何处，以及需要多久"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重複用藥最終穩定在何處，以及需要多久"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where each regularly dosed substance settles, based on your log's cadence" : {

    },
