        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "來源衝突時以哪個為準，以及內建物質資料的自選更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you wait or if you just need to calm down:" : {
      "localizations" : {
