            "value" : "你的體重"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your body weight sizes every estimate to you — and your heart rate shows how your body actually answered each dose, right on the session timeline." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的体重会让每项估算贴合你自己——而你的心率会直接在记录时间线上，显示身体对每次用量的真实反应。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的體重會讓每項估算貼合你自己——而你的心率會直接在記錄時間軸上，顯示身體對每次用量的真實反應。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your brain adapts to what you keep giving it" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你一直用，大脑就会去适应它"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你一直用，大腦就會去適應它"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your brain burned through dopamine and norepinephrine faster than usual." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的大脑比平时更快地消耗了多巴胺和去甲肾上腺素。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的大腦比平時更快地消耗了多巴胺和去甲腎上腺素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your central nervous system was being suppressed and is now rebounding." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的中枢神经系统之前被抑制,现在正反弹。"
